      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انكبّ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a jug, or the like) <i>was,</i> or <i>became,
inverted,</i> or <i>turned down, so as to pour out its
contents.</i> (IB, in TA, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرَبٌ</span>.) ― 
